those things where like,

00:02:38.111 --> 00:02:40.274
this is what you do,
this is what you give up.

00:02:40.274 --> 00:02:44.402
You sacrifice these things
when nature happens.

00:02:44.402 --> 00:02:45.299
You know what I mean?

00:02:45.299 --> 00:02:47.331
And it's just-
- But I love it.

00:02:47.331 --> 00:02:48.164
Do you love it?

00:02:48.164 --> 00:02:52.581
- The running water situation
is like, it'll kill me.

