00:05:54.322 --> 00:05:55.863
- I crammed like a mad woman.

00:05:55.863 --> 00:05:59.476
I never was acade...
Academics were not my thing.

00:05:59.476 --> 00:06:01.754
And so when I got this role, I was like,

00:06:01.754 --> 00:06:03.324
"Wow, I wanna study.

00:06:03.324 --> 00:06:05.588
Get me like... Where do I start?"

00:06:05.588 --> 00:06:08.235
