file with all these videos

00:06:08.235 --> 00:06:10.086
of her deposition,
especially her deposition,

00:06:10.086 --> 00:06:11.881
and all the interviews she had done.

00:06:11.881 --> 00:06:12.714
And I just studied.

00:06:12.714 --> 00:06:14.324
I kept watching and listening and learning

00:06:14.324 --> 00:06:15.875
and trying to get her mannerisms.

00:06:15.875 --> 00:06:17.255
We absorb, we're human beings.

00:06:17.255 --> 00:06:19.006
Like even if we're not acting actors,

00:06:19.006 --> 00:06:22.414
