anything in my vocal cords.

00:07:11.422 --> 00:07:12.581
- Or get laryngitis. Yeah.

00:07:12.581 --> 00:07:13.422
- Get anything. Yeah.

00:07:13.422 --> 00:07:14.848
- 'Cause talking is worse than singing.

00:07:14.848 --> 00:07:15.681
People don't realize that.

00:07:15.681 --> 00:07:16.732
- Interesting.

00:07:16.732 --> 00:07:19.063
- Yeah. Talking is way harder
on your voice than singing.

00:07:19.063 --> 00:07:19.903
That's why people are like,

00:07:19.903 --> 00:07:21.815
"Oh, this singer got laryngitis
and missed her concert."

00:07:21.815 --> 00:07:23.020
I'm like, probably wasn't from singing.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:24.891
Was probably doing a billion
interview she didn't wanna do.

00:07:24.891 --> 00:07:27.966
- Exactly. Have you ever
gotten like a really bad-

00:07:27.966 --> 00:07:29.778
