00:07:40.592 --> 00:07:41.709
What? They gave me a show.

00:07:41.709 --> 00:07:43.025
- I Know.
- Yep.

00:07:43.025 --> 00:07:43.956
- Same, I get it.

00:07:43.956 --> 00:07:44.854
- Yeah.
- I get it.

00:07:44.854 --> 00:07:45.960
- But that's hard though
when you're trying

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.145
to like force something that
your voice isn't normal.

00:07:48.145 --> 00:07:50.513
