00:07:52.381 --> 00:07:55.439
There's like a roundedness to
it. There's all this stuff.

00:07:55.439 --> 00:07:57.304
It's taxing, but great.

00:07:57.304 --> 00:07:58.647
- Yeah. It's what a fun job.

00:07:58.647 --> 00:07:59.648
